            "review_text": "Excursion58239790616\n1 contribution\n0\nStaff training needed\nMar 2026 • Friends\nComing home just yesterday, it looks like the staff didn’t take the local very well. The food was ok, but the attitude of the servers was not ok, both men and women. When you’re finished with your meal, you’ll order an extra bottle of spring water, which usually comes with a glass of stone, but if you only bring up the same bottle of spring water as you mentioned, the staff will bring in a glass of stone. While Travelers rave as they do with attention, why??? We sit down at table 16 at 15:30. Address:56 Nguyen Thi Minh Khai, Nha Trang\nRead more\nTranslated from Vietnamese\nShow original\nWritten March 2, 2026",
