            "review_text": "Blue Sky\nHà Nội41 contributions\n0\nMust try if you going to Nha Trang\nJul 2019 • Friends\nWell - known local food is \" Nem Nuong\" which you must try in Nha Trang. I love their \" Nem Nuong\" sauce that I even try it before but \" nem nuong\" was not hot so when I ate them I didn't feel their taste. Deep -fried spring rolls were amazing which my mom always make it to me and the size of it make me supersized. Prices was reasonable and staffs were friendly but the atmosphere was noisy and closed seats that make me not comfortable. I will recommend to my friends if they come Nha Trang.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 7, 2019",
